<Base title="Privacy Policy | FormFix India" description="Privacy policy for FormFix India: browser-local processing, no document uploads, and what the site owner still needs to disclose about analytics and ads.">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">All document processing in this version happens locally in your browser. This site does not create an upload endpoint, does not send your document bytes, images, filenames or contents to a server, analytics provider or advertising vendor, and does not save uploaded files to localStorage, IndexedDB or other persistent browser storage. Temporary object URLs and canvases are released when you reset a tool or leave the page.</p><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Limitations: browser-local processing does not protect a file already on a shared device, and it does not make a downloaded output private. If the site owner later enables analytics or AdSense, this page must be updated with the actual providers, cookies and consent behaviour before those scripts are enabled. Until then, advertising is disabled and no advertising script is loaded.</p><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Contact for privacy questions: see the <a class="underline" href="/contact/">Contact page</a>. The owner must add a real contact address before public launch; none is invented here.</p>
</Base>
